      <p>I grew up picking sweet corn for market on our family's place in Putnam County. After college I worked in sales and marketing at Traders Point Creamery, back when their milk and yogurt were making it onto shelves across the country. Then I owned Wildwood Market, a grocery in Indianapolis full of local food, and learned the hard way what it takes to get people in the door every week.</p>
      <p>These days I also build online stores and run email and ads for food brands that ship nationwide. Cultivate is where I bring what I've learned there to small farms.</p>
